### Add a borrower
POST http://localhost:5000/api/borrowers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Borrower", "phone": "0700000000" }

### List all borrowers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/borrowers

### Loan A - on time
POST http://localhost:5000/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrower": "6af2144f8f9d8c6c8b6840b0",
  "collateral": "Test laptop",
  "amountTaken": 20000,
  "durationWeeks": 1,
  "dateGiven": "2026-11-09"
}

### Loan B - overdue
POST http://localhost:5000/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrower": "6af2144f8f9d8c6c8b6840b0",
  "collateral": "Test phone",
  "amountTaken": 10000,
  "durationWeeks": 1,
  "dateGiven": "2026-11-01"
}

### List loans
GET http://localhost:5000/api/loans

### Summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/loans/summary